    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Musengwa Katonda yaalagira Musa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akobere Abaisiraeli ati, “Ole bw'aneeyamanga okughaayo omuntu eri Musengwa Katonda ng'ekigheebwayo, omuntu oyo agheereibwayo anaanunulwanga omughendo ogw'empiiya guno, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ogunaabalirirwanga ku mbala entongole ey'omu isinzizo: Bw'anaabanga omusaadha ow'emyaka okuva ku makumi abiri okutuuka ku nkaaga anaanunulwanga ebitundu amakumi ataanu (50) ebya feeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'anaabanga omukazi anaanunulwanga ebitundu amakumi asatu (30) ebya feeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'anaabanga omwisuka okuva ku myaka etaanu okutuuka ku makumi abiri anaanunulwanga ebitundu amakumi abiri (20) ebya feeza. Ate omuguna anaanunulwanga ebitundu ikumi (10) ebya feeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'anaabanga omwana omulenzi ali ghansi w'emyaka etaanu anaanunulwanga ebitundu bitaanu (5) ebya feeza. Ate omughala akaali eibodhe anaanunulwanga ebitundu bisatu (3) ebya feeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'anaabanga omusaadha aswisa mu myaka enkaaga anaanunulwanga ebitundu ikumi na bitaanu (15) ebya feeza. Ate omukazi nga yeena aswisa mu myaka enkaaga anaanunulwanga ebitundu ikumi (10) ebya feeza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye ole eyeeyama bw'anaabanga omwavu, nga taghanga kusasulira ku mbalirira eyo anaaleetanga omuntu oyo ye yeeyama okughaayo mu maiso ga kabona, kabona yaamubaliramu omughendo ogwa ghansi, ng'ajiira ku busobozi bw'oyo ali kughaayo eyeeyama.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Obweyamo bwe bunaabanga obw'okughaayo ensolo eikirizibwa okuba ekigheebwayo eri Musengwa Katonda, olwo ebigheebwayo byonabyona buli muntu by'anaaghangayo eri Musengwa Katonda, binaabanga bitukuvu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ensolo ey'ekigheebwayo, omuntu taagikyusengamu kutaagho yindi, oba okufaanisaamu enungi mu kifo ky'embi, oba embi mu kifo ky'enungi. Bw'anaakolanga atyo, olwo ensolo dhombi dhinaabanga dha Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye obweyamo bwe bunaabanga obw'okughaayo ensolo etali nongoofu, etaikirizibwa kuba kigheebwayo eri Musengwa Katonda, omuntu oyo anaagitwalanga eri kabona, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kabona yaabalirira omughendo ogugijaamu, ng'ajiira ku bulungi oba ku bubi bwayo. Omughendo gw'anaabaliriranga n'ogunaabanga ogw'enkomerero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo agireese bw'anaayendanga okuginunula, anaasasulanga omughendo gwayo, yaagaitaku n'ekitundu kirala kirala ku buli bitundu bitaanu eby'omughendo ogwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.13"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omuntu bw'anaaghangayo endhu ye ebe eya Musengwa Katonda, kabona anaabaliriranga omughendo ogugijaamu ng'ajiira ku birungi oba ku bitali birungi ebigiriku. Omughendo gw'anaabaliriranga n'ogunaabanga ogw'enkomerero. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oyo agighaireyo bw'anaayendanga okuginunula, anaasasulanga omughendo gwayo, yaagaitaku n'ekitundu kirala kirala ku buli bitundu bitaanu eby'omughendo ogwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omuntu bw'anaaghangayo ekitundu ky'eitaka lye yasikira, libe erya Musengwa Katonda, omughendo gwalyo gunaabalwanga nga babonera ku bungi bw'ensigo edhimala okusiga mu itaka eryo. Eitaka erimalagho kilo amakumi abiri edh'ensigo ya sayiri linaabalirirwangamu ebitundu bya feeza bitaanu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bw'anaaghangayo eitaka eryo ng'omwaka omutukuvu gwakawaaku, linaabanga ku mughendo omwidhuvu ogulibaliriirwamu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ate bw'anaalighangayo nga ghabiseegho entangama bukyanga omwaka omutukuvu guwaaku, kabona anaalibaliriranga omughendo gwalyo, ng'ajiira ku myaka egikaasigaireyo okutuuka ku mwaka omutukuvu ogwiraku, olwo yaakendeezanga ku mughendo gwalyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ole aghaireyo eitaka eryo bw'anaayendanga okulinunula, anaasasulanga omughendo gwalyo ogubaliriirwa, yaagaitaku n'ekitundu kirala kirala ku buli bitundu bitaanu eby'omughendo ogwo, olwo lyasigalanga nga likaali lirye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aye bw'ataayendenga kulinunula, oba bw'anaaliguzanga omuntu owundi ng'akaali kulinunula, tairengayo kwikirizibwa kulinunula. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka omutukuvu ogunaiririranga, linaafuukiranga irala lya Musengwa Katonda enaku dhoonadhoona, olwo linaabanga lya bakabona.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omuntu bw'anaaghangayo eri Musengwa Katonda eitaka lye yagula obugule, nga tiyalisikira, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kabona anaabaliriranga omughendo gw'empiiya ogulijaamu, ng'ajiira ku myaka egikaasigaireyo okutuuka ku mwaka omutukuvu. Olwo omuntu aghaireyo eitaka eryo yaasasula omughendo ogwo ku lunaku olwo lwene, era empiiya dhinaabanga dha Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu mwaka omutukuvu, eitaka eryo linairizibwanga mwene lyo eyalitunda, oba abasika be.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
