              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Kub 18:21",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "DEU.14.22+DEU.14.23+DEU.14.24+DEU.14.25+DEU.14.26+DEU.14.27+DEU.14.28+DEU.14.29"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ma 14:22-29",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omuntu bw'anaayendanga okununula ekirala ku bitundu ebyo, ka kibe eky'ensigo oba eky'ebibala eby'emiti, anaasasulanga omughendo ogukijaamu nga gubaliriirwa ku mbala entongole ey'eisinzizo, yaagaitaku n'ekitundu kirala kirala ku buli bitundu ebitaanu eby'omughendo ogwo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku buli nsolo ikumi enfuge, endala enaabanga ya Musengwa Katonda. Ensolo dhaimwe, ka dhibe ente oba entaama oba embuzi, bwe dhinaabanga nga dhiri kubalibwa, ku buli ikumi munaatoolangaku ndala yaaba ya Musengwa Katonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 27:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mwene nsolo taayawulengamu nungi na mbi, era taadhifaanisengamu. Bw'anaatoolanga ensolo n'agifaanisaamu eyindi, dhombi dhinaagheebwangayo eri Musengwa Katonda, era tidhiinunulwenga.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.27.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.27.33"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
